-- Chat draft record (spec docs/spec-ai-chat-draft.md): one row per call to POST /requests/chat-draft, written by the
-- backend for developers to read in the database. Never holds the message text.
-- The first part is generated by `prisma migrate diff`; the second part is hand-written (see the earlier hand-written
-- migration for why): CHECK constraints and row-level security.

